    <TD STYLE="width: 0in">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(b)</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">For purposes of the Plan, the following events shall not be deemed a termination of a Service Relationship:</TD>
